<SourceComposition width={930} height={165} spaceBefore={96} sourceNode="1273:14404" wide={false} align="left"><div data-node-id="1273:14404" class="[word-break:break-word] font-['Hanken_Grotesk'] font-normal leading-[0] relative shrink-0 text-[color:#0a0a0a] text-[length:22px] w-[930px]"><p class="leading-[1.5] mb-0">Hally's has been serving its Parsons Green neighbourhood for over a decade — a cosy, welcoming café that had never quite had branding to match. Anna, the owner, wanted a fresh, elegant identity that still felt like the place regulars already loved: engaging, energetic, unmistakably itself.</p><p class="leading-[1.5] text-[22px]">​</p></div></SourceComposition>
